\section{Priors}{

The coefficients have conjugate normal priors whose variances are the error
variance divided by \code{h}, and each error variance has an inverse-gamma prior
with shape \code{nu / 2} and rate \code{lambda_m / 2} or \code{lambda_y / 2}. Each part
